		{
			description: [
				"Biomes O' Plenty adds more than fifty biome types, while Terralith continues shaping the terrain. Existing land is preserved; the new selection appears only in chunks nobody has generated before."
				"Travel from a distant waystone or in one agreed direction so the server does not generate wasteful strips everywhere."
				"Nature's Compass locates biomes but does not remove travel cost or chunk generation. Search deliberately, coordinate with other explorers, and stop once the team has a useful route rather than generating an enormous empty frontier."
				"New world-generation content appears only in chunks that have never existed before. Old mapped land remains valid; cross its border and watch for abrupt discovery changes instead of deleting the world."
			]
			id: "78D1163EEBD92C65"
			rewards: [{
