			description: [
				"Lavender fields and other flower-rich regions add colour without changing survival progression. Collect a small sample and leave the landscape recognisable."
				"Bring saplings and a small renewable sample home, but leave the original ecosystem recognisable. A palette library is more useful than stripping every rare grove around its first waypoint."
